<<<
6. Possessive, & other belongings, of one. By other belongings are meant the reflexive, & the form to be used when the pronoun ome has already been used & is wanted again either in propria persona or by deputy;
===
**6.** Possessive, & other belongings, of *one*. By other belongings are meant the reflexive, & the form to be used when the pronoun *one* has already been used & is wanted again either *in propria persona* or by deputy;
