<<<
as, when Caesar has been named, he can be afterwards called either Caesar or he, so, when one has been used, is it indifferent whether it is repeated itself or represented by he &c. ?
===
as, when Caesar has been named, he can be afterwards called either *Caesar* or *he*, so, when *one* has been used, is it indifferent whether it is repeated itself or represented by *he* &c.?
